# Docker build context = only what package installation and image verification
# need. The development/research harness stays outside the delivered image.

# everything by default...
*
# ...then re-include the product surface (NOTE: the image ships the PRODUCT readme
# `delivery/README.md`, NOT the dev/research root README.md):
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!delivery/
delivery/*
!delivery/README.md
!src/
!docker/
docker/*
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!docker/verify_open_image.py

# defensively drop heavy/irrelevant things even if a re-include pulls a parent dir
**/__pycache__
*.egg-info
*.pyc
